OL,3,GNEWSAGotta catch 'em all: Why Pokemon
OL,4,Ais booming again
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou might remember swapping Pokemon
OL,7,Fcards in the playground or racing home
OL,8,Fto watch the television series, but the
OL,9,Fphenomenon has grown into something
OL,10,Fmuch bigger.
OL,12,FThe Japanese franchise is enjoying a
OL,13,Fresurgence in popularity, with longtime
OL,14,Ffans rediscovering their childhood
OL,15,Ffavourite and a new generation joining
OL,16,Fthe craze.
OL,18,FFrom rare cards worth thousands of
OL,19,Fpounds to international gaming
OL,20,Fcompetitions, Pokemon is bringing
OL,21,Ftogether enthusiasts of all ages.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
